# v2.1.2

# =====================================================================================
#  BUILDSCRIPT-MANAGED .gitattributes
# =====================================================================================
#  Everything ABOVE the "USER SECTION" marker at the bottom is overwritten whenever the
#  buildscript is updated (./gradlew updateBuildScript). Do not edit it.
#  Add your own rules BELOW the marker; that part is never touched by updates.
#
#  The first line ("# v<version>") is the version header, generated from
#  'buildscript_version' by ./gradlew syncBuildScriptVersion. Keep it on line 1.
#
#  Git applies the LAST matching rule for an attribute, so rules in the user section
#  override the managed rules above them.
#
#  Sections:
#    1. Line endings   normalisation and per-type overrides
#    2. Text files     file types treated as text
#    3. Binary files   file types treated as binary
#    4. Gradle wrapper wrapper jar handling
# =====================================================================================

# ---- 1. Line endings ----------------------------------------------------------------

# Normalise on commit, check out LF everywhere. Windows contributors included.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows scripts need CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Unix scripts need LF
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# ---- 2. Text files ------------------------------------------------------------------

*.glsl text
*.gradle text
*.groovy text
*.info text
*.java text
*.json text
*.json5 text
*.kt text
*.kts text
*.lang text
*.mcmeta text
*.md text
*.properties text
*.scala text
*.toml text
*.xml text
*.yaml text
*.yml text

# ---- 3. Binary files ----------------------------------------------------------------

*.class binary
*.dat binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.gif binary
*.jar binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jpg binary
*.nbt binary
*.ogg binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.so binary
*.ttf binary
*.wav binary
*.zip binary

# ---- 4. Gradle wrapper --------------------------------------------------------------

# Keep the wrapper jar out of diffs, it is verified by checksum
**/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar binary linguist-vendored linguist-generated

# ---- USER SECTION (everything below is kept on buildscript updates) -----------------
